OL,3,A'This is sabotage': Hegseth defends
OL,4,AIran war record after Republican
OL,5,Alaunches impeachment attempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS lawmakers are weighing whether to
OL,8,Fsupport a Republican congressman's
OL,9,Fattempt to impeach Defence Secretary
OL,10,FPete Hegseth
OL,12,FThey will vote later on Tuesday to
OL,13,Fdecide if the House of Representatives
OL,14,Fshould move forward on Thomas Massie's
OL,15,Fmeasure accusing Hegseth of waging war
OL,16,Fon Iran without congressional
OL,17,Fauthorisation
OL,19,FSpeaking at the Pentagon for the first
OL,20,Ftime in six months, the defence
OL,21,Fsecretary called the impeachment effort
OL,22,Fa "farce" and added: "This is sabotage"
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
