OL,3,A'This is sabotage': Hegseth defends
OL,4,AIran war record after Republican
OL,5,Alaunches impeachment attempt
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn addition to Massie, Democratic
OL,8,Flawmakers such as minority leader
OL,9,FHakeem Jeffries say they back
OL,10,Fimpeaching Hegseth, but President
OL,11,FDonald Trump says his defence secretary
OL,12,Fgets an "'A' PLUS"
OL,14,FVice-President JD Vance has blamed the
OL,15,Fwar for Republicans' sweeping midterms
OL,16,Flosses, but says it is "absurd" to
OL,17,Fsuggest Hegseth has committed
OL,18,Fimpeachable crimes
